WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.064
This video shows how to create a lesson plan and publish it on a phone.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:14.314
Tap the menu button, open Planning and Delivery and choose Lesson Plans. Then tap Add Lesson Plan.

00:00:16.298 --> 00:00:24.866
The window starts with the bulk form. Tap Create single lesson plan at the top, then choose Standard for the full details.

00:00:27.424 --> 00:00:33.616
Type the title, choose the class and the subject, then tap Select Teacher and pick the teacher.

00:00:49.393 --> 00:00:58.393
Tap Select chapter or topic. Tick a topic from the book and tap Apply. The form says one item is selected.

00:01:01.969 --> 00:01:05.785
Set the lesson date and write an objective for the lesson.

00:01:19.224 --> 00:01:30.072
Leave the status as Draft and tap Create Lesson Plan. A message confirms it. To see the plan, choose the class and the lesson date in the filters.

00:01:52.187 --> 00:01:58.811
Tap Publish on the plan to share it. A message confirms that the lesson plan is published.

00:02:08.154 --> 00:02:12.762
The lesson plan is published, and its topics now count as covered.
